# Build context for backend/deploy/Dockerfile.
#
# The backend image builds from the REPOSITORY ROOT, not from backend/,
# because the binary depends on the sibling modules capability/ and sdk/go/,
# which a backend-only context cannot reach (`go mod download` fails
# resolving the relative replaces in backend/go.mod).
#
# Widening the context from one component to the whole repo means everything
# not excluded here is streamed to the Docker daemon on every uncached build.
# Docker reads only the file at the context root, so backend's rules live
# here, re-rooted.
#
# The frontend image is unaffected: it still builds from frontend/ with its
# own frontend/.dockerignore.

# ── Components the backend image does not build ─────────────────────────
frontend/
deploy/
docs/
specs/
sdk/python/
tasks/
.specify/
.agents/
.github/
.rtk/
.hypothesis/

# ── VCS / CI metadata ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.gitleaks.toml
lefthook.yml
release.config.cjs
package.json
package-lock.json
node_modules/
renovate.json

# ── Repo-root docs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.md
!capability/README.md

# ── Build artifacts (Go output anywhere in the tree) ────────────────────
bin/
out/
dist/
*.test
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Named binaries built at the backend root by local dev flows. Both are
# gitignored and weigh tens of MB; without these they land in the context on
# every uncached build.
backend/server
backend/seed-fixture

# ── Coverage / profile output ───────────────────────────────────────────
coverage/
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
*.out
profile.cov

# ── Test trees the build never reaches ──────────────────────────────────
backend/tests/grpcurl/reports/
backend/tests/api/mutations/reports/
backend/tests/api/security/reports/
backend/tests/integration/testdata/

# ── Secrets / local-only ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Runtime configs are mounted via Helm ConfigMap or a compose bind mount,
# never baked in.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
backend/configs/local/

# ── Editor / OS / agent detritus ────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.claude/

# ── Logs ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log

# ── Repo-tooling configs not needed at build time ───────────────────────
backend/.golangci.yaml
backend/.mockery.yaml
backend/skills-lock.json
backend/scripts/
backend/docs/
Taskfile.yaml
backend/Taskfile.yaml
backend/tasks/

# ── Trees the Dockerfile does not COPY ──────────────────────────────────
# Real source, but the binary build never reaches them: policies/ ships
# Cedar fixtures used by tests and docs. If a future Dockerfile starts to COPY one, drop
# the matching line.
#
# backend/tools.go used to be here. The tools stage now copies it, so that
# `go install` resolves the generators from this module's own dependency
# graph instead of from a second set of version pins maintained by hand.
backend/policies/
